  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CATALI.5&#xb0;T Initiative: Concerted Action To Accelerate Local I.5&#xb0; Technologies &#x2013; Latin America and West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will establish and implement regional technical assistance and investment grant platforms that build a portfolio of early-stage climate ventures in Latin America and West Africa. 
Each regional CATALI.5&#xb0;T will provide support for start-ups and young businesses with the highest climate mitigation impact and business growth.  

&#x2022; There is an opportunity to leap-frog emissions intensive development pathways in Latin America and West Africa. It provides critical financial and non-financial support to support climate mitigation start-ups which develop transformative home-grown solutions and provide demonstration effects and replicable models. 
&#x2022; The MORSE (Model for Regional climate Start-up Ecosystem impacts) model is a first-of-its kind climate technology innovation impact model for developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
